---
import { Icon } from "astro-icon/components";
---

<div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 bg-primary-light flex flex-col items-center justify-center rounded-2xl py-5 min-h-96 gap-7">

    <p class="max-w-2xl text-black font-Anton text-center text-3xl lg:text-4xl">
        Estamos listo para ayudarte a crear una web profesional que impulse tu negocio.
    </p>

    <a href="/contactanos"
    class="group font-Anton text-xl text-black flex gap-5 py-4 px-16  
    hover:bg-black hover:text-primary-light  hover:rounded-4xl
    transition-transform duration-500 ease-in-out">

        CONTÁCTANOS

        <Icon name="icon-park-outline:arrow-right-up" class="size-7  group-hover:rotate-45 transition-transform duration-500 ease-in-out" />
    </a>

</div>